  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.290" end="00:06.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="00:06.850" end="00:13.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="00:13.530" end="00:20.530" ttm:agent="v1">Broke my self-esteem, to let you back in</p>
      <p begin="00:20.530" end="00:27.580" ttm:agent="v1">Put myself in pieces, could you imagine</p>
      <p begin="00:27.580" end="00:30.650" ttm:agent="v1">How could you just leave me</p>
      <p begin="00:30.650" end="00:34.050" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me with our memories</p>
      <p begin="00:34.050" end="00:39.970" ttm:agent="v1">I can't help but wonder why</p>
      <p begin="00:39.970" end="00:47.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You broke my heart (ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="00:47.120" end="00:54.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You broke my heart (ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.910" end="00:58.510" ttm:agent="v1">Used to be, your favorite bad bitch</p>
      <p begin="00:58.510" end="01:01.840" ttm:agent="v1">Used to feel your hands on my skin</p>
      <p begin="01:01.840" end="01:08.860" ttm:agent="v1">Used to need your body on mine, cuz you were all mine, hit me on my phone line</p>
      <p begin="01:08.860" end="01:12.120" ttm:agent="v1">This ain't the first time I've been going crazy</p>
      <p begin="01:12.120" end="01:15.520" ttm:agent="v1">This is the last time you gon call me baby</p>
      <p begin="01:15.520" end="01:19.130" ttm:agent="v1">This is a deadline, I'm done playing easy</p>
      <p begin="01:19.130" end="01:22.510" ttm:agent="v1">You're gonna wish that you never ever met me</p>
      <p begin="01:22.510" end="01:26.170" ttm:agent="v1">You pulled a knife</p>
      <p begin="01:26.170" end="01:29.620" ttm:agent="v1">Still I survived</p>
      <p begin="01:29.620" end="01:34.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wonder why (why)</p>
      <p begin="01:34.730" end="01:41.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You broke my heart (ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:41.930" end="01:48.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You broke my heart (ah-ah-ah, you broke my, you broke my)</p>
      <p begin="01:48.680" end="01:55.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You broke my heart (ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:55.750" end="02:02.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You broke my heart (ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="02:02.490" end="02:03.990" ttm:agent="v1">You break my heart</p>
      <p begin="02:03.740" end="02:09.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p>
